OL,3,GNEWSA'Youth violence and tension' rises
OL,4,Ain south London
OL,5,
OL,6,F"There are parents who think next time
OL,7,Fwe come to their door, it will be to
OL,8,Ftell them their child is dead."
OL,10,FI'm told this by PC Zoe Ticehurst and
OL,11,Fher colleague, Det Con Faisal El
OL,12,FIssaoui.
OL,14,FThey are showing me around the
OL,15,Fneighbourhoods of Lambeth and Southwark
OL,16,Fin south London, where some children
OL,17,Fare highly vulnerable to the gangs who
OL,18,Foperate there.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
